Popup Hide, Download Hide, Close Button sirf Close

{
    "show_privacy_popup": false,

    "download_button_visible": false,
    "download_button_url": "",

    "close_button_action": "close",
    "close_button_url": ""
}

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

| Key                       | Values                                 |
| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `show_privacy_popup`      | `true`, `false`                        |
| `download_button_visible` | `true`, `false`                        |
| `download_button_url`     | Any valid URL                          |
| `close_button_action`     | `"close"`, `"url"`, `"both"`, `"none"` |
| `close_button_url`        | Any valid URL                          |
